[Bb]Wiping out every liv[C]ing being from the [Dm]sights
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Noah was six hundred [C]years old that [Dm]day
[Bb]Went into the ark to keep [C]the family [Dm]safe
